Whether you're stuck in a job with limited progression, returning to work, or simply looking for a new challenge, a career in IT could be closer than you think.

At Switch to IT, we help people from all backgrounds gain the knowledge, confidence, and strategy needed to secure their first IT role.

No technical background? No problem.

Many successful IT professionals started with no experience. The key is having the right guidance and a clear plan.

---

## Career Discovery Call

Not sure whether IT is the right fit for you?

Book a free discovery call and we'll discuss:

- Your current situation and career goals
- Whether a move into IT is realistic for you
- Which IT career paths may suit your skills and interests
- The steps needed to get started

Sometimes all it takes is a conversation to discover opportunities you never knew existed.

![Career planning session](/images/career-planning.jpg)

---

## IT Career Coaching

Breaking into IT can feel overwhelming when you don't know where to start.

Our coaching programme provides personalised guidance to help you:

- Build the technical knowledge, practical skills and confidence employers look for in entry-level IT candidates
- Understand the IT industry and available career paths
- Build a practical learning roadmap
- Create a professional CV and LinkedIn profile
- Develop interview confidence
- Learn how to apply for entry-level IT roles effectively
- Avoid common mistakes that slow down career changers

You'll have a clear action plan and ongoing support throughout your journey.

---

## Job Search & Interview Support

Getting interviews is one challenge. Turning them into job offers is another.

We help you:

- Improve your CV
- Optimise your LinkedIn profile
- Prepare for technical and behavioural interviews
- Build confidence when speaking with recruiters and hiring managers
- Present your transferable skills effectively

The goal is simple: position yourself as a strong candidate for your first IT role.

---

## Why Choose Switch to IT?

Many people believe they're too old, lack experience, or don't have the right qualifications to work in IT.

The reality is that employers hire people from a wide range of backgrounds every day.

We focus on practical advice, honest guidance, and proven strategies to help you take the first steps towards a career in technology.

